  "job_B3.3.32_20261117_184745": {
    "chunk_text": "oh \u00feis \u00fe\u00e6t Simon de\u00fe. \u00dea ahof Paulus up his heafod. \u00dea w\u00e6ron his eagan gefyllede mid tearum, & he geseah Simon fleogendne. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe he to Petre, To hwan ablinnest \u00feu, Petrus? Freme nu for\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ongunne. So\u00felice unc gecy\u00fee\u00fe ure Drihten H\u00e6lend Crist his m\u00e6gen. \u00dea Neron \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrde, \u00fea smercode he & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Nu \u00feas men geseo\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hie synt ofercumene; Petrus cw\u00e6\u00fe, Nu swi\u00fee ra\u00fee \u00fee bi\u00f0 cu\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t wit ne dwelga\u00fe. Locode \u00fea up wi\u00fe Simones & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ic eow halsige scucna englas, ge \u00fee hine on \u00fe\u00e6re lyfte bera\u00fe to & hie \u00fea sona hine forletan, & he gefeol on \u00feone stocc be \u00fe\u00e6re st\u00e6nenan str\u00e6te \u00fee is haten Sacra uia, \u00d0a genaman men eft \u00feone stoc on weg, & feower syllice stanas on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan stowe alegdon, to \u00dea heht Petrus & Paulus on bendum healdon, wende \u00fe\u00e6t he Simon arisan sceolde \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge. Petrus cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fees Simon ne arise\u00fe n\u00e6fre, for\u00feon \u00fee he is so\u00f0lice dead & on ecum witum geny\u00feerod. \u00dea heht Neron healdan Simones lic \u00fery dagas, wende \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde eft arisan \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge. Ahsode \u00fea Petrus, Hwa lyfde \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu swylce scylde gefremedeste? Petrus cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gif \u00feu wilt ongeotan & ge\ufffd",
